# ── Databases & backups ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# SQLite lives in db/ (see deploy.sh, docker-compose.prod.yml). Never commit a
# production database or a backup of one. CI fails the build if one is tracked.
db/
*.db
*.db-journal
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
backups/
package-lock.json

# local database + backups
/db/
/backups/
